/**
 * @page rendering_overview Rendering System Guide
 *
 * # Overview
 * ## Architecture
 *
 * The rendering system is organized into several key features:
 * ### 1. @ref rendering
 * - @ref Vectrix::RenderCommand "RenderCommand" : Class that provides static methods for issuing rendering commands
 * - @ref Vectrix::Renderer "Renderer" : Central rendering manager for 3D scenes
 *
 * ### 2. @ref shaders
 * - @ref Vectrix::Shader "Shader" : Base class
 * - @ref Vectrix::ShaderManager "ShaderManager" : Class that help create and maintain shaders
 *
 * ### 3. @ref mesh
 * - @ref Vectrix::Mesh "Mesh" : Class that represents the geometry of a 3D model
 * - @ref Vectrix::VertexBuffer "VertexBuffer" : Vertex data
 * - @ref Vectrix::IndexBuffer "IndexBuffer" : Indexes for indexing
 *
 * ### 4. @ref textures
 * - @ref Vectrix::Texture "Texture" : Base class
 * - @ref Vectrix::TextureManager "TextureManager" : Class that help create and maintain textures
 */